<p>On the basis of exchange rates from 16-21 May, the UK average RMG is above +5 per cent at 5.335 per cent. It is therefore currently forecast to enter a fifth and final confirmation period on 26 May, prior to a possible revaluation on 5 June. All currencies with negative RMGs for this period will be devalued on 26 May by reducing their negative gaps to zero. Hence a devaluation is currently forecast for the Belgian green rate.</p>
